    "text": "@[category research open, AMS 26]\ntheorem mathoverflow_347178.variants.bounded_iff :\n    answer(sorry) ↔ ∀ᵉ (n ≥ 2) (f : ℝ^n → ℝ) (hf : ContDiff ℝ 1 f),\n        BddAbove (range f) ↔ BddAbove (range fun x ↦ f (x + gradient f x))",
